created: 2023-02-03, last updated: 2026-06-05, [Read more](https://qwik.dev/docs/validator/)

When submitting a request to a `routeAction()`, the request event and data undergo validation against the defined validator.
If the validation fails, the action will place the validation error in the `routeAction.value` property.
